    "Agents using this key stop working immediately. This can’t be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用此密钥的智能体将立即停止工作。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用此金鑰的代理程式將立即停止運作。此動作無法復原。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI agents such as Claude connect to this URL with an API key to add, search and list your summaries. They act as your account, from any device, and added summaries count against your allowance." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude 等 AI 智能体使用 API 密钥连接此 URL，即可添加、搜索和列出你的摘要。它们以你的账户身份操作，可在任何设备上使用，添加的摘要会计入你的额度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude 等 AI 代理程式使用 API 金鑰連接此 URL，即可新增、搜尋和列出你的摘要。它們以你的帳號身分操作，可在任何裝置上使用，新增的摘要會計入你的額度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
