      }
    },
    "One-time purchase through the App Store. Points are added to your account right away, with no recurring subscription." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过 App Store 一次性购买。积分会立即添加到你的账户，不会自动续订。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "透過 App Store 一次性購買。點數會立即加入你的帳號，不會自動續訂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only a hash of each key is stored, so a key can’t be shown again. Revoke a key you lost and create a new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个密钥只保存其哈希值，因此无法再次显示。如果遗失了密钥，请撤销它并创建新的密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個金鑰只儲存其雜湊值，因此無法再次顯示。如果遺失了金鑰，請撤銷它並建立新的金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open a page in Safari, click Share, and choose Chippy. The share extension turns the page into a summary without leaving your browser. You can also paste a link or choose a PDF in New Summary." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Safari 中打开网页，点按“分享”，然后选择 Chippy。分享扩展会将网页生成摘要，无需离开浏览器。你也可以在“新建摘要”中粘贴链接或选择 PDF。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Safari 中打開網頁，按一下「分享」，然後選擇 Chippy。分享延伸功能會將網頁轉成摘要，不必離開瀏覽器。你也可以在「新增摘要」中貼上連結或選擇 PDF。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open a page in Safari, tap Share, and choose Chippy. The share extension turns the page into a summary without leaving your browser." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Safari 中打开网页，轻点“分享”，然后选择 Chippy。分享扩展会将网页生成摘要，无需离开浏览器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Safari 中打開網頁，點一下「分享」，然後選擇 Chippy。分享延伸功能會將網頁轉成摘要，不必離開瀏覽器。"
          }
        }
